==History==
2023
*The Firecracker's Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 19/6/2023, in the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]].
*On 30/6/2023, a [[Version History#Maintenance%20Break%20(30/6/2023)|maintenance break]], increased the Evolved Firecracker’s first attack time interval to 0.65 seconds (from 0.6 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 8/8/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(8/8/2023)|Balance Update]], decreased the Evolved Firecracker's hitpoints to 130% of the original's (from 143%) {{Balance|Nerf}} and decreased her pushback range to 1.5 tiles (from 1.95 tiles) {{Balance|Nerf}}. It also made it so that Spark Damage does not stack {{Balance|Nerf}}.
2024
*On 14/5/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (14/5/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Big Spark's duration to 3 seconds (from 2.5 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}, the Small Spark's duration to 2.5 seconds (from 2 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}, allowed the Evolved Firecracker's sparks to slow enemies' speed by 15% {{Balance|Buff}}, and removed her hitpoints boost {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 16/12/2024, the [[Version History#2024 Quarter 4 Update (16/12/2024)|2024 Quarter 4 Update]], added a sound effect to the Evolved Firecracker after death.
2025
*On 30/1/2025, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (30/1/2025)|maintenance break]], made it so that damage boost from the [[Rune Giant]] would be split on Evolved Firecracker instead of being granted to each of her projectiles.
*On 4/2/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/2/2025)|Balance Update]], made it so that [[Lumberjack/Evolution|Lumberjack Ghost]] is immune to Evolved Firecracker's sparks.
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] decreased the Evolved Firecracker's sight range to 8 tiles (from 8.5 tiles) {{Balance|Buff}} and decreased her recoil range to 1 tile (from 1.5 tiles) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
2026

* On 6/4/2026, a Balance Update, increased her projectile speed by 25%

